ique Falco Gabby Connie and John  appeared to now be all on the same side  and they all appear to be preparing to  take on the Jaeger ists back when Aaron  first transformed into his new massive  Godzilla Titan form it seemed as if  nothing would be able to stop him  however we now have the cart Titan the  female Titan the colossal Titan the jaw  Titan and the armored Titan all on the  same team and we have Levi and Mikasa on  that same team as well so is it possible  that all of them together could come up  with some strategy to actually defeat  the gigantic Eren they have brilliant  strategists and tactician like han ji  and Armin on their side but what could  they possibly do to stop Godzilla and  millions of colossal Titans I think that  this unlike the Alliance will have no  problem overthrowing flock and the  Jaeger ist's if that is their intention  but taking on the Jaeger ist's and  stopping Aaron from destroying the world  are two completely different things  in the end they will all depend on how  much control Aaron actually has over the  wall Titans and other Titans in general  if Aaron has fully harnessed the power  of Emir fritz and he can control the  Titans at will then I don't see how even  this powerful alliance could defeat  Aaron in his current form but if for  some reason Aaron's control of the other  Titans is not as complete as we have  been led to believe then it might be  possible for the Rebel Alliance to come  up with a strategy for tag-teaming Eren  alternatively this could all be just a  prelude to a Code Geass type ending  where Aaron plays the role of Lelouch a  main character who becomes such a  villain that he succeeds in unifying the  entire world against him now that we're  actually seeing the marlins a lying with  Armin Mikasa hanji and Levi the idea  that Aaron could be the Titan version of  the louche has become a bit more likely  he is already uniting the world against  him in a way that would have been  impossible before he decided to become a  quote/unquote  so maybe the Lelouch scenario is exactly  what Issei Amma is going for personally  I hope that the attack on Titan ending  won't follow the Code Geass ending too  closely because I want to say I want to  do something new and surprising but  we'll have to wait and see what do you  guys think about this unholy alliance  between the Marlin invaders and lifelong  survey corps members can this alliance  last and can they do anything against  Aaron even with five Titan shifters and  two Ackerman's or is Aaron just to Opie  please give me your thoughts down in the  comments below if you enjoyed this video  and you want to see more attack on Titan  content on the channel please leave a  like to let me know and if you happen to  be new to anime uproar please don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications you really have to go  through the trouble of clicking the bell  and then selecting the option that says  all if you want to get our videos  otherwise YouTube will bury them it's  just the way it goes you can also hit me  up on Twitter and Instagram at anime  uproar for all the latest attack on  Titan news and updates I want to give a  big thank you to all of our anime uproar  patrons for making these videos possible  with all the problems constantly facing  YouTube patrons are more important than  ever thank you guys so much  first up let me think are the one tier  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including ingrid ah  Alan Adam the world Steelers the school  bus Tyson query no and a quiet respect  and of course I can't forget our pro  hero tier patrons including the one and  only Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason  Wilson Kings eldred's very dolla beat  Anatoli Cassatt's ki alpha do on hell  Cruz team Sparky 65 cricket XP Rohan  Kapoor Jessica Maloney Emperor otaku  Timothy Vargas Shawn dart Joe Stanton  jccc waka and John bunted if you enjoy  our videos and you feel that they  provide